{"product_id":"superfit-royce-gracies-ultimate-martial-arts-fitness-and-nutrition-guide-brazilian-jiu-jitsu-series","title":"Superfit: Royce Gracie's Ultimate Martial Arts Fitness and Nutrition Guide (Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu series)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Royce Gracie has teamed up with James Strom, fitness coach for Keyshawn Johnson, Serena Williams, and the University of Southern California Trojans, to create a customized program for martial artists. This unique program of strength training, cardiovascular routines, flexibility exercises, and nutrition includes step-by-step, full-color workout plans for beginner, intermediate, and black-belt practitioners. Provided are guidelines for working out solo or with a partner, information on complete nutritional programs for different body types and martial art styles, and injury-prevention tips. This book is appropriate for beginning martial artists wanting to sharpen their bodies and minds, black-belt instructors looking for new ways to improve and motivate their students, or anyone interested in building a body of extreme effectiveness.\"\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Royce Gracie\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781931229333\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 216 x 265\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595540730009,"sku":"10RF9781931229333","price":30.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/superfit-royce-gracies-ultimate-martial-arts-fitness-and-nutrition-guide-brazilian-jiu-jitsu-series-744711.jpg?v=1694791614","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/superfit-royce-gracies-ultimate-martial-arts-fitness-and-nutrition-guide-brazilian-jiu-jitsu-series","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}